CommentsService — 1.1.0.2 Docker
Branch: CommentsService/v_1.1.0.2_VisualStudio

ENGLISH
Visual Studio 2026: open CommentsService.slnx (.NET 10 SDK; ASP.NET/web workload).
Solution builds the API; Frontend contains editable React files. Docker builds the complete app.
Dockerized frontend/API and persistent PostgreSQL. Application data integration is next.
Requirements: Docker Engine, Compose v2.24+, Git, Python 3.
From the repository root:
  python3 scripts/init-env.py
  docker compose -p commentsservice up -d --build --wait
  curl --fail http://127.0.0.1:8080/health
Optional persistent test database:
  docker compose -p commentsservice --profile testing up -d --wait test-database
Stop without deleting data:
  docker compose -p commentsservice --profile testing down
Never use down -v for retained data. Keep project name/environment file unchanged.
Instructions: README.md. History: change.log.

